{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK7ElementQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Element","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK5IndexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Index","text":"Index"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A predicate used to partition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the collection. All elements satisfying this predicate are ordered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after all elements not satisfying it."}]}],"name":"belongsInSecondPartition"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The index of the first element in the reordered collection"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that matches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":". If no elements in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collection match "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":", the returned index is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equal to the collection’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"endIndex"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After partitioning a collection, there is a pivot index "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no element before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate and every element at or after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":". This operation isn’t guaranteed to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stable, so the relative ordering of elements within the partitions might"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the following example, an array of numbers is partitioned by a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate that matches elements greater than 30."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var numbers = [30, 40, 20, 30, 30, 60, 10]","let p = numbers.partition(by: { $0 > 30 })","\/\/ p == 5","\/\/ numbers == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30, 60, 40]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers"},{"type":"text","text":" array is now arranged in two partitions. The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[..<p]"},{"type":"text","text":", is made up of the elements that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not greater than 30. The second partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[p...]"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made up of the elements that "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"are"}]},{"type":"text","text":" greater than 30."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let first = numbers[..<p]","\/\/ first == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30]","let second = numbers[p...]","\/\/ second == [60, 40]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the order of elements in both partitions changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" in the original collection,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but, after calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"partition(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is the length of the collection."}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EmptyCollection"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","p